            </Box>
            <Box style={{ paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 4, paddingBottom: 4, border: '1px solid rgba(242,247,248,0.14)', borderRadius: 3 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontSize: 9, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.60)' }}>8 MIN</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 4, paddingBottom: 4, border: '1px solid rgba(107,200,209,0.28)', borderRadius: 3 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontSize: 9, color: '#6BC8D1' }}>TEACHING</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Text style={{ marginTop: 18, fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontSize: 9, color: '#6BC8D1', letterSpacing: 1.2 }}>LEARNING OBJECTIVES</Text>
        <Text style={{ marginTop: 7, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 10.3, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.58)', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>· 对比区域级放行与主机对主机放行的粒度</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 10.3, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.58)', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>· 验证 Default DENY 下未显式允许一律不可达</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 10.3, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.58)', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>· 在不破坏必要业务的前提下收紧过宽放行</Text>

        <Text style={{ marginTop: 14, fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontSize: 9, color: '#6BC8D1', letterSpacing: 1.2 }}>WATCH FOR</Text>
        <Text style={{ marginTop: 7, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 10.3, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.58)', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>没有任何 Zone 级放行；pc01 → app 有一条过宽主机放行，攻击状态可沿它到达应用服务并获得数据访问。</Text>

        <Text style={{ marginTop: 14, fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontSize: 9, color: '#E78172', letterSpacing: 1.2 }}>TASK</Text>
        <Text style={{ marginTop: 7, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 10.3, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.58)', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>收紧 pc01 → app 的过宽放行，保护 Customer Database，同时保持两条必要业务可达。</Text>

        <Box style={{ marginTop: 12, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 7 }}>
